  "autoMode": [
    "GUI automation of this Mac through mac-control-router (peekaboo, osascript/System Events UI scripting, open -a/-g, sleep, killall Dock/Finder/SystemUIServer/ControlCenter, defaults write of UI preferences) is allowed. The mac-control-router PreToolUse guard enforces security policy and asks for sensitive actions."
  ]
}
